MAPA NÍVEL 1



Este arquivo define a localização de todos os objetos 3D.



=========================================================



--- ZONA 1: INÍCIO (JOGADOR) ---



ENTITY player

TRANSFORM 0.0 0.0 -200.0

PHYSICS 0.0 0.0 0.0 0.9

PLAYER_CONTROL

WEAPON_SLOTS weapon_left weapon_right

COLLISION -1.0 -1.0 -1.0 1.0 2.0 1.0



--- PATRULHA INIMIGA ---



ENTITY scout_patrol_1

TRANSFORM -50.0 0.0 -150.0

RENDER 1 255 255 255 255  # ID 1 = MODEL_ID_ENEMY_SCOUT

AI_CONTROL 60.0 20.0

WEAPON WEAPON_PULSE_LASER 0.5 150.0 5.0 100.0 0.0 2 2

COLLISION -1.0 0.0 -1.0 1.0 3.0 1.0



ENTITY scout_patrol_2

TRANSFORM 50.0 0.0 -150.0

RENDER 1 255 255 255 255  # ID 1 = MODEL_ID_ENEMY_SCOUT

AI_CONTROL 60.0 20.0

WEAPON WEAPON_PULSE_LASER 0.5 150.0 5.0 100.0 0.0 2 2

COLLISION -1.0 0.0 -1.0 1.0 3.0 1.0



